{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2021-06-17 16:05:00', 'title': 'ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF PUBLIC OFFERING OF 7,000,000 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'PASADENA, CALIF., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. ("ALEXANDRIA" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: ARE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF 7,000,000\xa0SHARES OF THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK AT A PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE OF $184.00 PER SHARE.'}